# Claude, Master Thief

> Claude is a gold lane marksman who wins by preparing one controlled entry, not by standing still and out-ranging the enemy carry. Pick him when your team can start fights for him and when the enemy crowd control has visible cooldowns. If he has to invent every engage alone, Blazing Duet becomes a donation button.

