### Gold Lane Default (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Corrosion Scythe, Hunter Strike, Wind of Nature
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Corrosion Scythe
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Malefic Gun over Hunter Strike when Use when range and movement speed let Claude start fights without committing the mirror too deeply.; Sea Halberd over Hunter Strike when Use when healing, shields, or extra-HP bruisers keep the first target alive through Blazing Duet.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic or mixed burst when physical immunity will not stop the first collapse.
- Total cost: 10860 gold

Default ranked setup that reaches Claude's DHS plus Golden Staff engine quickly, then adds chase tempo and one physical-burst answer.

### Front-to-Back Anti-Tank (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Corrosion Scythe, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Corrosion Scythe
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Malefic Gun over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy has moderate armor but Claude needs safer basic-attack range more than scaling penetration.; Wind of Nature over Malefic Roar when Use when a physical diver can bypass the front line before Claude finishes the first target.; Hunter Strike over Sea Halberd when Use when the enemy front line is durable but does not rely on healing or shield recovery.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Tank-breaking setup for grouped objective fights where Claude can hit the nearest durable target behind reliable peel.

### CC-Heavy Survival (Gold)

