- Flex: Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when the main threat is physical burst rather than magic or mixed burst.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against front-loaded magic burst that decides the fight before a revive can matter.; Radiant Armor over Immortality when Use against repeated magic damage that chips Claude before every objective fight.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

Defensive setup for control-heavy drafts where Claude must survive the first lockout before committing Blazing Duet.

